humb/scwipc.jpg"}, {"id": 1517233, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwipd.jpg"}], "slug": "artificial-selection", "storyline": "Saeva, a socially anxious teenager, finds himself trapped in a building along with 13 other \"Sinners\". Their captors accuse them of being criminals and explain that the only way to escape is by proving their worth and potential for improvement.\n\nThe only problem is... Saeva can't think of any crime he's supposed to have committed. How do you repent for something you can't remember doing?\n\nHelp him recover his memories and unravel the underlying mystery \u2014 all while trying not to die!", "summary": "Artificial Selection is a multi-route mystery visual novel with escape room puzzles set in a distant future where the death penalty is commonplace.\n\nFourteen supposed criminals are forced to take part in an anti-death game, and you are one of them: To receive a second chance, you must overcome various life-threatening challenges together. Discover the motives of the other participants and help them avoid killing each other.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/artificial-selection", "videos": [{"id": 147749, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "WTnD1qckvtY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WTnD1qckvtY", "title": "Artificial Selection \u2014 Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WTnD1qckvtY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}